  Run docmgr help to explore documentation topics.                            
                                                                              
  Run docmgr help --ui to open the interactive help TUI.                      
                                                                              
  ## Usage:                                                                   
                                                                              
  docmgr [command]                                                            
                                                                              
  ## Available Commands:                                                      
                                                                              
  • **api**           HTTP API server                                         
  • **changelog**     Manage changelog entries                                
  • **completion**    Generate the autocompletion script for the specified    
  shell                                                                       
  • **config**        Inspect docmgr configuration                            
  • **configure**     Create or update a .ttmp.yaml at the repository root    
  • **doc**           Document workspace operations                           
  • **doctor**        Validate document workspaces                            
  • **export-sqlite** Export workspace index to a SQLite file (for            
  debugging/sharing)                                                          
  • **help**          Help about any command or topic                         
  • **ignore**        Inspect docmgr ignore decisions                         
  • **import**        Import external sources                                 
  • **init**          Initialize a docs root (ttmp/) with vocabulary,         
  templates, and guidelines                                                   
  • **list**          List tickets or documents                               
  • **meta**          Manage document metadata                                
  • **milestone**     Recoverable ticket milestones                           
  • **search**        Search documents by content and metadata                
  • **skill**         List and show skills                                    
  • **status**        Show overall status of the documentation root           
  • **task**          Manage ticket task lists                                
  • **template**      Manage and validate templates                           
  • **ticket**        Ticket workspace management                             
  • **validate**      Validation utilities                                    
  • **vocab**         Manage workspace vocabulary                             
  • **workspace**     Workspace initialization and configuration commands     
                                                                              
  ## Flags:                                                                   
                                                                              
        -h, --help    help for docmgr                                         
       --long-help    Show long help                                          
         --verbose    Show workspace banner and coaching output (off by       
  default)                                                                    
                                                                              
  Use docmgr [command] --help for more information about a command. Use docmgr --
  help --long-help for information about all flags.                           


